  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix: use portable mkdir for create_file mode by @mmustafasenoglu in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/780\r\n* fix: return Permissions::default() on Windows instead of panicking (#781) by @mmustafasenoglu in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/782\r\n* fix: detach silent commands into their own process group by @mmustafasenoglu in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/783\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @mmustafasenoglu made their first contribution in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/780\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/compare/v1.1.1...v1.1.2",
